  #line-at(70.824pt, 145.7pt, "Element 2). A slight increase in signal - corresponding to four gray levels (second row) - enabled a ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 158.3pt, "resolution of 0.98 µm (Group 9, Element 1). Further increases in exposure time (third row),  led to a ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 171.02pt, "final resolution of 0.87 µm (Group 9, Element 2), matching the resolution obtained under long-exposure ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 183.62pt, "conditions, where holograms contained approximately 150 gray levels (fourth row). This indicates that ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 196.22pt, "the proposed PSR with TV reconstruction pipeline is capable of preserving high spatial resolution and ")
